   Boolean-to-arithmetic mask conversion; correlation power analysis (CPA);
   differential power analysis (DPA); hash-based message authentication
   codes (HMACs); physical attack; secure hash algorithm (SHA);
   side-channel attack (SCA) countermeasure; test vector leakage assessment
