   lash{}end\{document\} when tackling complex problem instances on CPUs,
   while also observing significant benefits on different GPU processing
   scenarios. Consequently, the proposed strategies effectively facilitate
   the definition of energy-aware execution environments for phylogenetics,
   improving other literature approaches in terms of time and energy
   consumption.},
